{"4023530": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Beeing", "steam_appid": 4023530, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023530/extras/004b5a66c6d08f70eb898b8c74141f86.poster.avif?t=1759858166\" width=800 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023530/extras/004b5a66c6d08f70eb898b8c74141f86.webm?t=1759858166\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023530/extras/004b5a66c6d08f70eb898b8c74141f86.mp4?t=1759858166\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up in an unpleasant place with no memory of how you got there. A strange world unfolds before you, inhabited by creatures trying to convince you of their own “truths.” They appear not as characters but as discursive functions, competing for your attention.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023530/extras/d40895d35aeb61a4f3124f14ddfcb928.poster.avif?t=1759858166\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023530/extras/d40895d35aeb61a4f3124f14ddfcb928.webm?t=1759858166\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023530/extras/d40895d35aeb61a4f3124f14ddfcb928.mp4?t=1759858166\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an arthouse black comedy about power, dependency, and the search for meaning in a world where information has long since decayed into buzzing noise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’ll encounter long dialogues, quests, illustrated cutscenes, a bullet hell sequence, and scraps of toilet paper with curious lore about the game world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023530/extras/5e49f9efbc61a0ed2227bb0470d0aac9.poster.avif?t=1759858166\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023530/extras/5e49f9efbc61a0ed2227bb0470d0aac9.webm?t=1759858166\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023530/extras/5e49f9efbc61a0ed2227bb0470d0aac9.mp4?t=1759858166\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choices will determine how the story ends: with “victory,” “defeat,” or one of many bizarre fatal finales (over ten in total — each with its own achievement).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023530/extras/639a8a29a45ffc5a61718d882a8e4975.poster.avif?t=1759858166\" width=800 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023530/extras/639a8a29a45ffc5a61718d882a8e4975.webm?t=1759858166\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023530/extras/639a8a29a45ffc5a61718d882a8e4975.mp4?t=1759858166\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two</strong> major narrative branches, <strong>two</strong> core endings, and countless side deaths waiting to happen on your way out of the pit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The bee — <strong>female protagonist</strong> — is trying to cope with the world’s hardships through sheer positivity. Will she succeed?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>17</strong> unique characters, not all of whom will keep buzzing until the end.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A treat for those who remember us from the ukrainian narrative jam:</strong> now with illustrated scenes for the game’s key events and extra save slots!</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023530/extras/004b5a66c6d08f70eb898b8c74141f86.poster.avif?t=1759858166\" width=800 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023530/extras/004b5a66c6d08f70eb898b8c74141f86.webm?t=1759858166\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023530/extras/004b5a66c6d08f70eb898b8c74141f86.mp4?t=1759858166\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up in an unpleasant place with no memory of how you got there. A strange world unfolds before you, inhabited by creatures trying to convince you of their own “truths.” They appear not as characters but as discursive functions, competing for your attention.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023530/extras/d40895d35aeb61a4f3124f14ddfcb928.poster.avif?t=1759858166\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023530/extras/d40895d35aeb61a4f3124f14ddfcb928.webm